\* All TLC check configs for AntflyShardSplitSeq.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyKeySetCutover = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    CutoverPreservesAllFencedWrites
    SecondWriteCannotBeCollapsedByKey
    Safety

==== BadFencedWriteDropped
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyShardSplitSeq.tla.
\* Reuses the key-set cutover mutant, pinned to the fence-coverage invariant:
\* cutover completes while a fenced parent write has not been replayed.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyKeySetCutover = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    CutoverPreservesAllFencedWrites

==== BadKeySetCutover
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyShardSplitSeq.tla.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyKeySetCutover = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    SecondWriteCannotBeCollapsedByKey
